            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.1.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mub 1:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.1.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ntyo naagaruka naareeba obwengye n'obugwa-iraro n'obushema; mbwenu ekindi eki ohungurira omugabe yaakukora niki? kureka ebibaire byakozirwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima naareeba ku obwengye burikukira obushema, nk'oku omushana gukira omwirima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.9.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mub 9:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.17.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enf 17:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omunyabwengye agira amaisho, kwonka omushema agyendera omu mwirima ataine ki arikureeba; n'obu kiraabe kiri kityo, nkeetegyereza ngu omuheru gwabo boona guba gumwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo kuteekateeka omu mutima gwangye nti: Ebihika aha mushema, naanye nibyo birimpikaho. Mbwenu shi, okumukiza obwengye nikingasira ki? Ntyo naagira omu mutima gwangye nti: Ekyo nakyo ni busha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.1.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mub 1:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Manya, omunyabwengye n'omushema nikyo kimwe; tihariho origuma naijukwa, ahabw'okuba omu biro ebiriija bombi baryaba baayebire. Ka n'eihano omunyabwengye kufa nk'omushema! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:17"
          },
