              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mbwenu n'oha orikumanya yaaba ariba omunyabwengye nari omushema? Kwonka niwe ariba mukama wa byona ebi naafeereire kubi ninkoresa obwengye bwangye ahansi y'eizooba. Ekyo nakyo ni busha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
